        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "AN EXCELLENT INVESTMENT BY ANY STANDARDS A WONDERFUL 2 BED 2 BATH FIRST FLOOR APARTMENT WITH CAR SPACE IDEALLY SITUATED IN THE HIGHLY SOUGHT AFTER THORNFIELD SQUARE COMPLEX IN CLONDALKIN DUBLIN 22 \r\n\r\n EARLY VIEWING IS HIGHLY ADVISED.... \r\n\r\n Multi Award Winning Team Christina Wilson The Dublin Property Specialists are proud to present No. 53 Thornfield Square to the Clondalkin property market. Thornfield Square is popular development of superior family homes tucked away in a secluded position. Every conceivable amenity is literally on your doorstep. No. 53 will no doubt appeal to first time buyers, investors, parties trading up and parties downsizing alike. \r\n\r\nThis fine apartment has been maintained to a high standard so is in excellent condition throughout. The floor plan briefly consists of: Entrance hall, spacious living / dining room area plus kitchen, two bedrooms to include primary en-suite, a family bathroom and hot press. The hall door opens to an ideal family home. The generous living / dining room with kitchen area is flooded with natural light. This beautiful apartment boasts top grade flooring throughout. The attractive bright and airy designer kitchen offers an abundance of worktop and storage space. This beautiful apartment has two large double bedrooms each fitted with wardrobes. Also the master bedroom boasts an en-suite bathroom. The family bathroom has top quality sanitary ware. Added to this it features an attractive balcony area and communal green. The property has double glazing throughout and a top quality electric central heating system. This apartment has a dedicated car space included. \r\n\r\nIdeally situated in the heart of Clondalkin Village, with access to an abundance of local amenities including shops, schools, and restaurants. The location is second to none only a short distance from Dublin City Centre with Dublin International Airport easily accessible. This property is a short distance from excellent public transport links including the 13, 68, 69 bus routes and the Luas Red Line (Red Cow Stop). The N7 & M50 motorways are also very easily accessed, as is the Liffey Valley Shopping Centre and the Square Shopping Centre both only a short drive away. Clondalkin village is serviced with excellent facilities including local GP services, medical centre's, sports and recreational clubs and many shopping outlets. Nearby Corkagh Park is one of Dublin’s largest parks covering over 290 acres where local residents enjoy many amenities such as a large playground, fishing lakes, pet farm, a dog park, cycling, running and a host of other sports. Also the property falls into an excellent catchment of both primary and secondary schools making it a real winner with families. This is a most strategically positioned address. \r\n\r\n Early viewing is highly advised…\r\n\r\nMgt Fee €2000 per annum.\r\n\r\n***All information provided is to the best of our knowledge. The utmost of care and attention has been placed on providing factual and correct information. In certain cases some information may have been provided by the vendor to us. We do not hold any responsibility for mistakes, errors or inaccuracies in our online advertising and give each and every viewer the right to get an opinion on any concern they may have***"
      },
